                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "def39491-00fa-3593-a198-8785714d5d71",
                        "entry_id": "e85505b1-d8b8-3fa4-a200-8e1889fd4d61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Suggestive of an earlier event or times."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "92f903e2-1fcd-44e6-9c55-39e9a5a4af7a",
                                "sense_id": "def39491-00fa-3593-a198-8785714d5d71",
                                "text": "It was reminiscent of the rallies held by Adolph Hitler during the 1930s-1940s before adoring crowds in Nazi Germany. At many of these Nazi rallies, the German participants swore personal allegiance to their nation’s leader-Adolph Hitler over and above their own Nation-Germany."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a987a69e-d7d8-3212-968b-d959c2afad08",
                        "entry_id": "e85505b1-d8b8-3fa4-a200-8e1889fd4d61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tending to bring some memory etc. to mind (followed by of)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "179a5078-f143-4a0e-a53d-bd9485176a7c",
                                "sense_id": "a987a69e-d7d8-3212-968b-d959c2afad08",
                                "text": "That painting is very reminiscent of Picasso's later work."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4558be41-0feb-4294-816a-97e99401af60",
                                "sense_id": "a987a69e-d7d8-3212-968b-d959c2afad08",
                                "text": "The epidermal cells of the capsule wall of Jubulopsis, with nodose \"trigones\" at the angles, are very reminiscent of what one finds in Frullania spp."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12eca14f-983e-3d6f-b04d-e2b095977a2e",
                        "entry_id": "e85505b1-d8b8-3fa4-a200-8e1889fd4d61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Remembering; undergoing reminiscence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45d05a06-f6b1-4159-a613-93bbf27beaac",
                                "sense_id": "12eca14f-983e-3d6f-b04d-e2b095977a2e",
                                "text": "Some other state of existence, of which we have been previously conscious, and are now reminiscent."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
